keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - exchange fees
  - trading costs
  - maker taker
  - open data
  - MCP
abstract: >-
  Base-tier maker and taker trading fees for 15 crypto exchanges (CEX, DEX and
  perpetual DEX), each figure read from the exchange's official fee page and
  recorded with its source URL and the date it was read. Distributed as JSON
  and CSV, with an MCP server for AI assistants.
